:name: RP2350 in Renode
:description: Runs a Zephyr image built for the cortex_m33 board.

# Zephyr starts this with $elf set to the image: "west build -t run" does,
# and so does twister. To start it by hand:
#
#   renode -e '$elf=@build/zephyr/zephyr.elf; include @cortex_m33.resc; start'

$name?="cortex_m33"

include $ORIGIN/../../../../scripts/rpi_pico2.resc
